# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# clotless.ca is canonical. canrgx.ca is held by the team but points here, so
# the two domains never compete as separate copies of the same site — and so a
# visitor landing on canrgx.ca is never misled into thinking this is the
# official SEDS-Canada programme site.
#
# 301 = permanent, which is what search engines need to consolidate the two.
https://canrgx.ca/*      https://clotless.ca/:splat   301!
https://www.canrgx.ca/*  https://clotless.ca/:splat   301!

# Canonicalise www -> apex on the primary domain too.
https://www.clotless.ca/*  https://clotless.ca/:splat  301!
